# This repository is edited on Windows and its container runs Linux.
#
# A shell script checked out with CRLF line endings fails in a way that reads
# like a missing file: the kernel takes "#!/usr/bin/env bash\r" literally and
# reports that bash\r does not exist. Force LF on the files Linux executes.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

